.TH BARE 1 "October 2026" "Bare 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
bare \- a web browser with no title bar
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bare
[\fIaddress\fR | \fIsearch words\fR | \fIfile\fR]...
.br
.B bare \-\-update\-filters
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bare opens a window with no title bar: one slim address bar above the page. A single argument is
opened as typed in the address bar (an address, an existing file, or a search); several arguments that
are all addresses or files open one tab each; anything else is searched for as one phrase. If Bare is
already running, the pages open as new tabs in that window.
.PP
Move the window by dragging the address bar (before you edit it) or the empty new-tab page; resize it
from any edge or corner; or hold Alt and drag anywhere.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-update\-filters
Download EasyList and EasyPrivacy, convert them for WebKit's content blocker, and store them. Bare does
this by itself, in a child process, a few seconds after starting when it has no lists yet or they are
a week old (a failed attempt is not repeated for six hours), and loads the result without a restart;
set \fBfilter_updates = false\fR in the config file to stop that. Until the lists have been fetched, a
small built-in list is used.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print the version.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B Ctrl+L, Ctrl+K, F6
Focus the address bar. With nothing typed it lists the other tabs.
.TP
.B Ctrl+T, Ctrl+W, Ctrl+Shift+T
New tab, close tab, reopen the last closed tab.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Tab, Ctrl+Shift+Tab, Alt+1 ... Alt+9
Next and previous tab; jump to a tab (Alt+9 is the last).
.TP
.B Ctrl+D
Bookmark the page, or remove its bookmark.
.TP
.B Ctrl+F, F3, Shift+F3
Find in the page, next match, previous match.
.TP
.B Alt+Left, Alt+Right, Ctrl+R, F5, Ctrl+Shift+R
Back, forward, reload, reload bypassing the cache.
.TP
.B Ctrl+plus, Ctrl+minus, Ctrl+0
Zoom in, out, reset.
.TP
.B F11
Fullscreen.
.TP
.B Ctrl+Q
Quit.
.PP
In the address bar, a leading \fB?\fR forces a search, \fB!w\fR \fBrust\fR searches only Wikipedia
(\fB!gh\fR, \fB!so\fR, \fB!aw\fR, \fB!it\fR select others), and \fB:de\fR sets the language.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/bare/config.toml
Settings; every key is optional.
.TP
.I ~/.config/bare/bookmarks.txt
Bookmarks: one "url title" per line, edit it by hand.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/bare/
History, cookies, site data, downloaded filter lists.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B BARE_HOME
Keep config, data and cache under this directory instead of the XDG locations.
